  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "The Duo2FA Integration in eCommerceGo SaaS introduces an additional layer of security, ensuring that both admins and users are protected from unauthorized access. This module leverages the trusted Duo Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) system to provide a robust security solution. By incorporating Duo2FA, eCommerceGo enhances the overall security framework, safeguarding sensitive data and user accounts with minimal effort.": "De Duo2FA-integratie in eCommerceGo SaaS introduceert een extra beveiligingslaag, die ervoor zorgt dat zowel beheerders als gebruikers worden beschermd tegen ongeautoriseerde toegang. ",
  "Easy Configuration with Required IDs": "Eenvoudige configuratie met vereiste ID's",
  "Setting up the Duo2FA module in eCommerceGo SaaS is straightforward. Administrators need to add the required IDs for both the admin and user accounts. This initial configuration is quick and user-friendly, ensuring that businesses can implement enhanced security measures without extensive technical knowledge. The simple setup process allows businesses to promptly benefit from the added security without disrupting their operations.": "Het opzetten van de Duo2FA-module in eCommerceGo SaaS is eenvoudig. ",
  "Secure Admin and User Logins": "Veilige beheerders- en gebruikersaanmeldingen",
  "Once the Duo2FA module is configured, both admins and users will be prompted to enter a unique authentication code upon logging in. This two-step verification process ensures that only authorized individuals can access the platform. By requiring an additional code, which is typically sent to a user’s mobile device, the risk of unauthorized access is significantly reduced. This added layer of security is crucial for protecting sensitive business and customer data.": "Zodra de Duo2FA-module is geconfigureerd, worden zowel beheerders als gebruikers bij het inloggen gevraagd een unieke authenticatiecode in te voeren. Dit tweestapsverificatieproces zorgt ervoor dat alleen geautoriseerde personen toegang hebben tot het platform. ",
  "Enhanced Protection Against Unauthorized Access": "Verbeterde bescherming tegen ongeoorloofde toegang",
  "The Duo2FA integration provides enhanced protection against unauthorized access and potential security breaches. With cyber threats becoming increasingly sophisticated, traditional password-based authentication methods are no longer sufficient. Duo2FA ensures that even if a password is compromised, unauthorized users will not be able to access the system without the second authentication factor. This dual-layered security approach is essential for maintaining the integrity of your eCommerce platform.": "De Duo2FA-integratie biedt verbeterde bescherming tegen ongeautoriseerde toegang en potentiële inbreuken op de beveiliging. ",
